#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:1
msgid "编程语言"
msgstr "Programming Languages"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;使用Yuescript、Teal和Lua等编程语言开发《灵数奇缘》游戏的教程有待补充。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Tutorials for developing the Luv Sense Digital game using programming languages such as Yuescript, Teal, and Lua are yet to be completed."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:7
msgid "Yuescript"
msgstr "Yuescript"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:10
#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:15
#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:41
msgid "Yuescript编程语言"
msgstr "Yuescript Programming Language"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:18
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;[Yuescript](https://yuescript.org)是一门编译成Lua运行的动态脚本语言，核心特色是语言极为简洁且富有表达力，非常适合编写快速迭代的游戏业务逻辑。是在制作《灵数奇缘》过程中同时开发维护的一门编程语言。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;[Yuescript](https://yuescript.org) is a dynamic scripting language that compiles to Lua. Its core features are extreme conciseness and expressiveness, making it well-suited for writing rapidly iterated game business logic. It is a programming language developed and maintained alongside the production of Luv Sense Digital."

