#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:27
msgid "Teal"
msgstr "Teal"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:29
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;[Teal](https://github.com/pigpigyyy/tl)是一个给Lua加上了静态类型检查功能的脚本语言。定位相当于Typescript对Javascript语言做的功能扩展。Dora"
" SSR引擎中内置了一个为适应C++ OOP接口导出而做了稍做修改（RP未被接受）的Teal编译器分支，修改的版本见地址：[Teal - "
"Dora](https://github.com/pigpigyyy/tl/tree/dora)。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;[Teal](https://github.com/pigpigyyy/tl) is a scripting language that adds static type checking to Lua. Its positioning is comparable to what TypeScript does for JavaScript. The Dora"
" SSR engine includes a slightly modified fork of the Teal compiler (with an unaccepted RP) adapted for C++ OOP interface export. The modified version can be found at: [Teal - "
"Dora](https://github.com/pigpigyyy/tl/tree/dora)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:31
msgid "Lua"
msgstr "Lua"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/technical-description/programing-languages.md:33
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;[Lua](http://www.lua.org)是Dora SSR引擎核心支持的编程语言。目前在使用Lua 5.4的版本。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;[Lua](http://www.lua.org) is the core supported programming language of the Dora SSR engine. Currently using Lua version 5.4."

